{"2553720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vigilante Racer", "steam_appid": 2553720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(IN Development now. Videos and images are from experiments and proofs that may not appear in the end game. These materials will be changed out before going on sale, to match what the end product is.)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft vehicles to race on ceilings, walls and tracks in the sky, to engage in thrilling battles, while navigating a corrupt Sci-Fi world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View the KICKSTARTER here: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your engines in the gravity bending Arena. Just don't fall off the edge, drifters make easy targets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553720/extras/1f82615b456e0ee37cce698a6690bad0.poster.avif?t=1786094540\" width=440 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553720/extras/1f82615b456e0ee37cce698a6690bad0.webm?t=1786094540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553720/extras/1f82615b456e0ee37cce698a6690bad0.mp4?t=1786094540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553720/extras/5658ca82120220a1677e6717937f2ad9.avif?t=1786094540\" width=750 height=528 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or enter the city in your Vigilante class vehicle to stop a bank robbery. You wish your real car could navigate this away:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553720/extras/d4df4eafeef0978614eadc34c8897d45.poster.avif?t=1786094540\" width=450 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553720/extras/d4df4eafeef0978614eadc34c8897d45.webm?t=1786094540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553720/extras/d4df4eafeef0978614eadc34c8897d45.mp4?t=1786094540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553720/extras/5de7676fc1502169bb85a3ecd2d35e7d.avif?t=1786094540\" width=800 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or go unlock real speed in a Sky class cruiser. Why draft and go around when you could draft and go under? Don't like your opponent? Push them off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553720/extras/8f6db43b4891c1a8253c316cc52b3b75.poster.avif?t=1786094540\" width=408 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553720/extras/8f6db43b4891c1a8253c316cc52b3b75.webm?t=1786094540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553720/extras/8f6db43b4891c1a8253c316cc52b3b75.mp4?t=1786094540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(IN Development now. Videos and images are from experiments and proofs that may not appear in the end game. These materials will be changed out before going on sale, to match what the end product is.)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft vehicles to race on ceilings, walls and tracks in the sky, to engage in thrilling battles, while navigating a corrupt Sci-Fi world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View the KICKSTARTER here: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your engines in the gravity bending Arena. Just don't fall off the edge, drifters make easy targets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553720/extras/1f82615b456e0ee37cce698a6690bad0.poster.avif?t=1786094540\" width=440 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553720/extras/1f82615b456e0ee37cce698a6690bad0.webm?t=1786094540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553720/extras/1f82615b456e0ee37cce698a6690bad0.mp4?t=1786094540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553720/extras/5658ca82120220a1677e6717937f2ad9.avif?t=1786094540\" width=750 height=528 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or enter the city in your Vigilante class vehicle to stop a bank robbery. You wish your real car could navigate this away:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553720/extras/d4df4eafeef0978614eadc34c8897d45.poster.avif?t=1786094540\" width=450 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553720/extras/d4df4eafeef0978614eadc34c8897d45.webm?t=1786094540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553720/extras/d4df4eafeef0978614eadc34c8897d45.mp4?t=1786094540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2553720/ex